  "contracts": [
    "Use the selected-face used line-height pair for ordinary and float fitting/flow; preserve CSS normal/DefaultLineHeight, short-line, leader and forced-break behavior.",
    "Empty ordinary boxes, captions and table rows add no invented text line; positive shadows/outlines retain paint without flow advance. Authored all-zero percentage rows share table surplus; mixed/positive allocation remains intact.",
    "Resolve image/frame used dimensions before the auto-axis ratio without overflow. Preserve raw MathML canvas/baseline and Core/Drawing/PDF geometry.",
    "External SVG with a valid viewBox fits the final image/background tile viewport. SVG without a viewBox retains intrinsic-scene projection; inline SVG raster safety and external caller-codec policy remain distinct."
  ],
